(JavaScript) 46 72 578 DS
% Font[Serif, 0, 10]
343 10 4 SF
( was created by Netscape for dynamic control over HTML pages -- the JavaScript code is embedded in ) 419 118 578 DS
(the HTML source, and executes within the browser while it displays the page. JavaScript can also be used in ) 440 72 567 DS
(server-side scripts. JavaScript looks very much like Java, so porting the tests from Java to JavaScript was fairly ) 454 72 555 DS
(straight-forward.) 69 72 543 DS
