(Jacl is much slower than the other languages. In some cases, tests that took under 10 seconds in Java took over 30 ) 463 72 354 DS
(minutes in Jacl. We therefore ran each test four times for Jacl, instead of 10 times as we did for the other languages.) 466 72 343 DS
