(that of raw Tcl8. When comparing Jacl and Tcl8 with Java, we must take into account the fact that Jacl and Tcl8 ) 455 72 310 DS
(times include the startup time. In general, we found that Jacl was so slow that the extra 0.75 seconds made little ) 455 72 299 DS
