343 10 4 SF
( set ) 17 518 328 DS
(to 50000. JavaScript successfully ran the test twice, but would cause the operating system to consume all available ) 465 72 316 DS
(memory if the test was run any more times. As a result, we took only two measurements for JavaScript.) 419 72 305 DS
