(This data presents something of a quandary for developers, as well as benchmarkers! Native threads should be more ) 466 72 210 DS
(robust, and only native threads will properly use a multi-processor machine \(we have a few in our research group\). ) 464 72 199 DS
(On the other hand, native threads present a serious performance obstacle. In the case of Tcl Blend, we have to use ) 458 72 187 DS
(native threads, since Tcl Blend does not work with Green threads.) 265 72 175 DS
